    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a unique psychological horror experience. In **SnaPaul**, explore a disturbing and mysterious house where every corner could hide unexpected horrors. This first-person game will make you experience rising tension and an atmosphere that will keep you on the edge of your seat throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nightmare that lasts only 30 minutes... but will stay with you far longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a brief yet intense experience, **SnaPaul** offers a storyline that will challenge you to overcome your own fear. There are no escapes: uncover the secrets of a house that harbors a dark and threatening past. But be warned... what seems safe may only be an illusion.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358820/extras/bf1254af7ed3a88a67cc8634ecd4e214.poster.avif?t=1743793073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358820/extras/bf1254af7ed3a88a67cc8634ecd4e214.webm?t=1743793073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358820/extras/bf1254af7ed3a88a67cc8634ecd4e214.mp4?t=1743793073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **First-Person Gameplay**: Experience fear firsthand as you explore dark, detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **Psychological Tension**: Every sound, every shadow, every movement could mark the beginning of a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **Claustrophobic Atmosphere**: The house you're trapped in is alive and threatening, and each step brings you closer to the truth... or madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **4 Unique Achievements**: Face your fears and prove your courage by unlocking all achievements. Each one marks a different encounter with terror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover what lurks in the darkness? Your mind and courage will be tested in **SnaPaul**. Can you face your fears and unlock all achievements? Brace your nerves, because once you enter... you'll never be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a unique psychological horror experience. In **SnaPaul**, explore a disturbing and mysterious house where every corner could hide unexpected horrors. This first-person game will make you experience rising tension and an atmosphere that will keep you on the edge of your seat throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nightmare that lasts only 30 minutes... but will stay with you far longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a brief yet intense experience, **SnaPaul** offers a storyline that will challenge you to overcome your own fear. There are no escapes: uncover the secrets of a house that harbors a dark and threatening past. But be warned... what seems safe may only be an illusion.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358820/extras/bf1254af7ed3a88a67cc8634ecd4e214.poster.avif?t=1743793073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358820/extras/bf1254af7ed3a88a67cc8634ecd4e214.webm?t=1743793073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358820/extras/bf1254af7ed3a88a67cc8634ecd4e214.mp4?t=1743793073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **First-Person Gameplay**: Experience fear firsthand as you explore dark, detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **Psychological Tension**: Every sound, every shadow, every movement could mark the beginning of a new nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **Claustrophobic Atmosphere**: The house you're trapped in is alive and threatening, and each step brings you closer to the truth... or madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* **4 Unique Achievements**: Face your fears and prove your courage by unlocking all achievements. Each one marks a different encounter with terror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover what lurks in the darkness? Your mind and courage will be tested in **SnaPaul**. Can you face your fears and unlock all achievements? Brace your nerves, because once you enter... you'll never be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "SnaPaul is a first-person psychological horror game where you explore a dark, mysterious house. With 30 minutes of intense gameplay and 4 unique achievements to unlock, every step brings you closer to a chilling finale. Face your fears and uncover hidden secrets in this unforgettable experience.",
